      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T07:37:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, linking the terminus to the EM object with `xyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.Object` is right, and this step works as it is, since the [configured_by association of Inventory.Item](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/96104) has been merged. I\u0027ve posted a [design for the whole discovery flow](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/96378), and if that direction is accepted, I\u0027d like to rework the discovery part of pldmd along those lines later.",
