      "writtenOn": "2026-10-27T08:33:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure which old patch you are referring to.\n\nBut mctp-reactor creates the association between EID and EM config. What we are adding here is the terminus (inventory created by PLDM) to EM association based on the association created by mctpreactor for EID.",
      "parentUuid": "6cf58a2f_68716f56",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 15,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 53
      },
      "revId": "52f30341a19b229cf1b094f976525868fcc2b3df",
